WEBVTT

1
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:51,150
Arrived home

2
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:58,160
How are you? Of course I can give this to you and you will be able to become a powerful person. Goodbye.

3
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,480
What's your name?

4
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:02,080
I am Gu Tangsheng, the lost member of the Gu family. See you next time if you have a chance.
